-- ==========================================================================
--  LayoutTool - reload everything (single command)
--
--  Usage:  $m %PMLLIB%\LayoutTool\mac\reload_layouttool.mac
--
--  When: after editing any object\*.pmlobj or form\*.pmlfrm
--    1) Objects MUST be reloaded, otherwise the old module stays in memory
--       and you get  (2,779) Method <XXX>.<method> not found
--    2) After reloading the FORM, close and reopen the form window so its
--       init code runs again (e.g. MethodSetDrawingSize recomputes the
--       table origins for the current sheet size). An open window does
--       NOT refresh itself.
--    3) If only one file changed, reloading that one is enough.
--
--  Scope: 16 objects + 1 form of this plugin.
--         CostElement  DimensionGenerator  DrawingExporter  DrawingGenerator
--         GridDataGet  GridGenerator       LabelGenerator   LimitDbelementGet
--         LimitsNoteGenerator  NoteGenerator  NozzleOrientationGenerator
--         SheetGenerator  TextWriter       ViewAnnotation   ViewConfig
--         XmlGenerator
--  Changed 23.162: MatchLineGenerator removed (0 callers since the Batch tab
--      was deleted; source parked in backup\ so it can be restored).
--      mac\PositionEastQickSort.pmlfnc removed (0 callers; also in backup\).
--      TextWriter.pmlobj added - it MUST be loaded before the generators
--      that call it, so it is listed explicitly.
--  Note:  PML functions in *.pmlfnc are picked up by "pml rehash all".
-- ==========================================================================
pml rehash all
pml reload object costelement
pml reload object dimensiongenerator
pml reload object drawingexporter
pml reload object drawinggenerator
pml reload object griddataget
pml reload object gridgenerator
pml reload object labelgenerator
pml reload object limitdbelementget
pml reload object limitsnotegenerator
pml reload object notegenerator
pml reload object nozzleorientationgenerator
pml reload object sheetgenerator
pml reload object textwriter
pml reload object viewannotation
pml reload object viewconfig
pml reload object xmlgenerator
pml reload form !!LayoutToolMain
-- Done. Now close and reopen the LayoutTool form (or reselect Size).
